flowchart TD
  A[Select suite browser and configuration] --> B{Managed environment?}
  B -->|Yes| C[Reserve port and start disposable app]
  B -->|No| D[Use configured QA endpoints]
  C --> E[Check health and ADMIN credentials]
  D --> E
  E --> F[Apply write guard]
  F --> G[Create test-owned Playwright session]
  G --> H{Test interface}
  H -->|UI| I[Browser context and page object]
  H -->|API| J[HTTP context and domain client]
  I --> K[Execute scenario and assert business result]
  J --> K
  K --> L{Passed?}
  L -->|No| M[Capture failed UI screenshot and trace]
  L -->|Yes| N[Close test resources]
  M --> N
  N --> O[Publish HTML XML and diagnostics]
  O --> P[Stop owned application after suite]
